flowchart LR
  POS[Store POS / offline queue]
  WEB[Web and CRM]
  LOY[Loyalty source]
  ODOO[Odoo / supplier intake]
  HUB[Authenticated integration hub]
  XW[ID and product crosswalks]
  OWN[Customer/product stewards]
  CORE[Operational golden IDs plus source links]
  DW[Warehouse]
  POS -->|signed event, replayable| HUB
  WEB --> HUB
  LOY --> HUB
  ODOO --> HUB
  HUB --> XW --> CORE
  XW -->|ambiguous candidates| OWN
  OWN -->|approved / rejected with audit| XW
  CORE --> DW
  DW -->|masked aggregates| BI[Role-filtered reporting]
